.studio
  // 原规则 `&-wrapper :global(.xxx-card-body)` 企图去掉卡体顶部内边距，但卡体是 .studio-wrapper
  // 的祖先而非后代，该规则一直是死代码；TDesign 卡体默认内边距的观感正确，因此不再保留。
  // / The old `&-wrapper :global(.xxx-card-body)` rule tried to remove the card body's top padding,
  // but the card body is the ancestor of .studio-wrapper, not a descendant, so it was always dead
  // code. TDesign's default card body padding renders correctly, so the rule stays dropped.

  &-preview
    width 100%
    max-width 600px
    display block
    margin 0 auto

.chat-panel
  height 100%

  // TDesign Card 卡体：撑满高度并纵向排列
  // / TDesign card body: full height, column layout
  :global(.t-card__body)
    height 100%
    display flex
    flex-direction column

.message-item
  font-size 12px
  line-height 20px
  padding 8px
  border-radius 2px

  &-actions
    display flex
    opacity 0

    &-item
      margin-right 4px
      font-size 14px
      color var(--td-text-color-placeholder)
      width 20px
      height 20px
      border-radius 50%
      display flex
      justify-content center
      align-items center
      cursor pointer

      &:hover
        background-color var(--td-bg-color-container-hover)

      &:last-child
        margin-right 0

  &-collected
    .message-item-actions-collect
      color var(--td-warning-color)

  &:hover
    background-color var(--td-bg-color-secondarycontainer)

    .message-item-actions
      opacity 1
